Modifications by rionmint (fork https://github.com/rionmint/grok-build-plugin-cc)
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Statement of changes (Apache-2.0 section 4(b)), 2026-11-12:

  * plugins/grok-build/scripts/session-lifecycle-hook.mjs: appendEnvVar no
    longer appends to CLAUDE_ENV_FILE. It reads the file, adds the new export,
    keeps only the last export of every variable (other lines are left as they
    are) and writes the file back only when it changed.
  * tests/session-env-file.test.mjs: new tests for the above.
  * Marketplace renamed from "xai-grok-build" to "rionmint-grok-build";
    version 0.2.1-rionmint.1 in package.json, plugin.json and marketplace.json;
    plugin author shown as "xAI (rionmint fork)".
  * README.md: a fork note at the top.

Statement of changes, 2026-11-12 (version 0.2.1-rionmint.2):

  * plugins/grok-build/scripts/lib/grok.mjs: runModelsProbe reports
    loggedIn: false when "grok models" prints "not authenticated" or
    "not logged in", even if it exits 0.
  * plugins/grok-build/scripts/lib/process.mjs: runCommand on Windows with a
    shell quotes each argument that needs it and passes one command line, so
    an argument with a space or "&" is no longer split or run as a second
    command (and Node's DEP0190 warning is gone). New export quoteForShell.
  * tests/fake-grok-fixture.mjs: an "unauthenticated-exit-0" scenario, and a
    grok.cmd shim on Windows so cmd.exe finds the fake grok.
  * tests/grok-cli.test.mjs, tests/process.test.mjs: tests for the above.
  * tests/bump-version.test.mjs: checks the fork version instead of 0.2.1.

